<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16824" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύν-θετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντίθημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uncompounded,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				78c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				205c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1252a19
			</span></i>; freq. in Gramm., as <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				172.27
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φωνή</span> a word
				<i>standing alone,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.50
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					17.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντίθεμαι</span>) <i>bound by no covenant,
				faithless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δῆμός ἐστιν πρᾶγμα τῶν πάντων
					ἀσυνθετώτατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.136
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσυνετ-</span>
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				1.31
			</span></i>; <i>making no covenants,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. διατελοῦσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1251.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
